**[REAL RESULT: any traction from the quick fixes, with timeframe]**

**[REAL RESULT: how many daily runs it took before the AI output was consistent]**

If a number isn't there yet, say so. "I'm still testing this" is an honest result.

## **Takeaway**

More information won't get you moving. A shorter list will. Pick three things, make each one actionable, decide how you'll measure them, and review on Friday.

